  "title": "VITAL: Visual-Semantic Dual Supervision for Enhanced and Interpretable Latent Reasoning in Medical MLLMs",
  "summary": "VITAL enables medical vision-language models to perform latent reasoning over continuous hidden states without explicit tokens, improving efficiency and interpretability. The framework addresses issues like modality collapse and train-inference mismatch, while providing a dual interpretability mechanism.",
